\title{张平：三维各向异性与经典不可压缩 Navier–Stokes 方程}
\date{2026-10-21}
\taxon{Reference}
\author{author}

\p{Ping Zhang，3-D Anisotropic vs. Classical Incompressible Navier–Stokes Equations，载 Proceedings of the International Congress of Mathematicians 2026，Volume 5: Invited Lectures (Sections 9–11)，pp. 388–407，2026年7月13日在线出版。[正式版全文与出版信息](https://epubs.siam.org/doi/10.1137/25M1801980)，[DOI](https://doi.org/10.1137/25M1801980)。}
\p{版权为 © 2026 International Mathematical Union，由 SIAM 按 [CC BY 4.0](https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/) 许可出版。本站[专题](4A00)是中文改编与重组，并加入独立的基础推导；未复制报告插图。原始研究论文各自的版权和许可不随报告许可改变。}
\p{Liu–Paicu–Zhang，Global well-posedness of 3-D anisotropic Navier–Stokes system with small unidirectional derivative，Arch. Ration. Mech. Anal. 238 (2020), 805–843，[DOI](https://doi.org/10.1007/s00205-020-01555-x)。固定预印本 [arXiv:1905.00156v1](https://arxiv.org/abs/1905.00156v1) 记为 LPZ-v1；本文涉及的具体原文位置为定理1.2、推论1.1、注1.1与§2。}
\p{Chemin–Zhang，On the critical one component regularity for 3-D Navier–Stokes system，Ann. Sci. Éc. Norm. Supér. 49 (2016), 131–167，[DOI](https://doi.org/10.24033/asens.2278)。固定预印本 [arXiv:1310.6442v1](https://arxiv.org/abs/1310.6442v1) 记为 CZ-v1；单分量定理为定理1.4，耦合估计见§2命题2.1–2.3及§5–8。}
\p{Dong Li、Ping Zhang，On the refined analyticity radius of 3-D generalized Navier–Stokes equations，[arXiv:2406.10865v2](https://arxiv.org/abs/2406.10865v2)，2025年6月5日版本，记为 LZ-v2。亚临界与临界解析半径分别见定理1.2、1.3。}
\p{其他主要引用包括 Paicu，[Équation anisotrope de Navier–Stokes dans des espaces critiques](https://doi.org/10.4171/rmi/420)，Rev. Mat. Iberoam. 21 (2005), 179–235；Paicu–Zhang，[Global solutions to the 3-D incompressible anisotropic Navier–Stokes system in the critical spaces](https://doi.org/10.1007/s00220-011-1350-6)，Comm. Math. Phys. 307 (2011), 713–759；Liu–Zhang，[Global solutions of 3-D Navier–Stokes system with small unidirectional derivative](https://doi.org/10.1007/s00205-019-01447-9)，Arch. Ration. Mech. Anal. 235 (2020), 1405–1444。}
\p{Zhang–Zhu 的连续依赖结果发表于 [J. Funct. Anal. 288 (2025), 110689](https://doi.org/10.1016/j.jfa.2024.110689)。Liu–Zhang 的大角 Fourier 模态结果发表于 [Adv. Math. 438 (2024), 109475](https://doi.org/10.1016/j.aim.2023.109475)。Ning Liu、Ping Zhang 的 Global Small Analytic Solution of 3-D Anisotropic Navier–Stokes System 发表于 [Arch. Ration. Mech. Anal. 248 (2024), 106](https://doi.org/10.1007/s00205-024-02051-2)。}
